    "update_note": "2026-11-20 first FOUNDATION pass (Jun 2026 data, after the Banks view shipped; BANKWISE_SPEC §8a). Six forces, each sourced on an official page read in the editor's Chrome: IDBI's recategorisation (Jan 2019), the 2020 PSB consolidation, HDFC Ltd into HDFC Bank (Jul 2023), PSB recapitalisation (Oct 2017), Prompt Corrective Action on weak PSBs (Apr 2017), and the Nov 2023 unsecured risk weights (shared with SIBC). Four new channels in the ontology. Not yet sourced: the other bank mergers declared as series breaks (Kotak/ING Vysya, SBI associates, Bank of Baroda/Dena/Vijaya, DBS/Lakshmi Vilas). Finding: no series break is declared for the bank groups at IDBI's move, so group growth a year to Dec 2019 carries it. No loops, risks or gaps authored: the lens is banks, and no relationship test has run on this pipeline."
